<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Austral Growth · Agencia de Marketing Digital</title>
<meta name="description" content="Impulsamos marcas mediante estrategia, contenido y marketing digital. Agencia del sur de Chile.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --navy-900:#0A1240;
    --navy-800:#0F1E4D;
    --navy-700:#183566;
    --ink:#161B2E;
    --muted:#6E748C;
    --soft:#F5F7FB;
    --line:#E7EAF2;
    --cyan:#12B0DE;
    --blue:#1170D8;
    --purple:#8A1FB8;
    --magenta:#B81C9E;
    --grad:linear-gradient(90deg,#12B0DE 0%,#1170D8 36%,#8A1FB8 70%,#B81C9E 100%);
    --grad-soft:linear-gradient(120deg,#12B0DE22,#8A1FB822);
    --shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(15,30,77,.14);
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{font-family:'Poppins',system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;line-height:1.6;overflow-x:hidden;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
  img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
  .grad-text{background:var(--grad);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;}
  .wrap{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px;}
  .eyebrow{font-size:.72rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;margin-bottom:20px;}
  .eyebrow::before{content:"";width:26px;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--grad);}
  h2.title{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3.6vw,2.85rem);font-weight:700;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--navy-800);}
  .section{padding:104px 0;}
  .lead{font-size:1.06rem;font-weight:300;color:#4b5169;max-width:620px;margin-top:16px;}

  /* NAV */
  header{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:50;transition:.3s;}
  header .bar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:74px;}
  header.scrolled{background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);box-shadow:0 1px 0 var(--line);}
  .logo-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;}
  .logo-nav .mk{height:34px;width:auto;}
  .logo-nav .wm{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.05em;font-size:1.06rem;color:#fff;transition:color .3s;}
  header.scrolled .logo-nav .wm{color:var(--navy-800);}
  nav.links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:34px;}
  nav.links a{font-size:.92rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--navy-800);opacity:.85;transition:.2s;}
  nav.links a:hover{opacity:1;}
  header:not(.scrolled) nav.links a{color:#fff;opacity:.9;}
  .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-weight:600;font-size:.92rem;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:40px;transition:.25s;cursor:pointer;border:none;}
  .btn-grad{background:var(--grad);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(138,31,184,.32);}
  .btn-grad:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(138,31,184,.42);}
  .btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:#fff;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4);}
  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);}
  .nav-cta{padding:10px 20px;}
  .burger{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:6px;}
  .burger span{width:24px;height:2px;background:#fff;border-radius:2px;transition:.3s;}
  header.scrolled .burger span{background:var(--navy-800);}

  /* HERO */
  .hero{position:relative;background:radial-gradient(1100px 620px at 78% -8%,#1B347A 0%,transparent 58%),linear-gradient(158deg,#0A1240 0%,#0F1E4D 52%,#16306B 100%);color:#fff;padding:150px 0 110px;overflow:hidden;}
  .hero::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-140px;bottom:-120px;width:460px;height:460px;background:radial-gradient(circle,#12B0DE33,transparent 66%);}
  .hero::after{content:"";position:absolute;right:6%;top:34%;width:360px;height:360px;background:radial-gradient(circle,#B81C9E2e,transparent 66%);}
  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;}
  .hero .eyebrow{color:#bfe6f5;}
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,6vw,4.6rem);font-weight:700;line-height:1.0;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin-bottom:20px;}
  .hero h1 .grad-text{filter:saturate(1.15);}
  .hero p.sub{font-size:1.12rem;font-weight:300;color:#c7cded;max-width:500px;margin-bottom:34px;}
  .hero .cta-row{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .hero-art{position:relative;display:flex;justify-content:center;}
  .hero-art img{width:100%;max-width:460px;filter:drop-shadow(0 24px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.45));animation:float 6s ease-in-out infinite;}
  @keyframes float{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-16px)}}
  .hero-stats{position:relative;z-index:2;display:flex;gap:44px;margin-top:64px;padding-top:30px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);}
  .hero-stats .s .n{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;}
  .hero-stats .s .l{font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9aa2c9;margin-top:2px;}

  /* DIAGNÓSTICO */
  .diag{background:#fff;}
  .diag .head{max-width:680px;}
  .tri{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px;margin-top:52px;}
  .tri .card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:34px 28px;transition:.28s;background:#fff;}
  .tri .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:var(--shadow);border-color:transparent;}
  .tri .card .dot{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--grad-soft);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:18px;}
  .tri .card .dot i{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--grad);display:block;}
  .tri .card h3{font-size:1.18rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy-800);}
  .tri .card p{font-size:.96rem;font-weight:300;color:#5a6076;margin-top:6px;}
  .tri .card p b{font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);}

  /* SERVICIOS */
  .serv{background:var(--soft);}
  .grid6{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px;margin-top:52px;}
  .mcard{background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:30px 28px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);transition:.28s;}
  .mcard::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:4px;background:var(--grad);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:.3s;}
  .mcard:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:var(--shadow);}
  .mcard:hover::before{transform:scaleX(1);}
  .mcard .idx{font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;}
  .mcard h3{font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy-800);margin:10px 0 7px;}
  .mcard p{font-size:.95rem;font-weight:300;color:#5a6076;}

  /* PROCESO */
  .proc{background:#fff;}
  .steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:26px;margin-top:52px;}
  .step{position:relative;padding-left:8px;}
  .step .n{font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1;}
  .step h3{font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy-800);margin:12px 0 5px;}
  .step p{font-size:.95rem;font-weight:300;color:#5a6076;}
  .rhythm{margin-top:56px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#0F1E4D,#183566);color:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:34px 40px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 30px;}
  .rhythm .lab{font-size:.74rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9db0e0;font-weight:600;margin-right:8px;}
  .rhythm .chip{font-size:.9rem;font-weight:500;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:30px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.09);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);}
  .rhythm .chip b{font-weight:600;}

  /* PLANES */
  .planes{background:var(--soft);}
  .plan-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:56px;align-items:stretch;}
  .plan{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:30px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:.28s;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
  .plan:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:var(--shadow);border-color:transparent;}
  .plan.hot{background:linear-gradient(165deg,#0F1E4D,#183566);color:#fff;border:none;transform:scale(1.04);box-shadow:0 24px 54px rgba(15,30,77,.32);z-index:2;}
  .plan.hot:hover{transform:scale(1.04) translateY(-6px);}
  .plan .tag{align-self:flex-start;font-size:.66rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:30px;background:var(--soft);color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px;}
  .plan.hot .tag{background:var(--grad);color:#fff;}
  .plan h3{font-size:1.18rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy-800);}
  .plan.hot h3{color:#fff;}
  .plan .price{font-size:2.15rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--navy-800);margin:6px 0 0;}
  .plan.hot .price{color:#fff;}
  .plan .price span{font-size:.85rem;font-weight:300;color:var(--muted);}
  .plan.hot .price span{color:#aeb8e0;}
  .plan .body{position:relative;flex:1;margin-top:20px;min-height:350px;}
  .plan .hint{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:.82rem;transition:opacity .3s;}
  .plan.hot .hint{color:#aeb8e0;}
  .plan .hint .arrow{font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1;}
  .plan .detail{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px);pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .35s ease,transform .35s ease;}
  .plan:hover .hint,.plan:focus-within .hint{opacity:0;}
  .plan:hover .detail,.plan:focus-within .detail{opacity:1;transform:none;pointer-events:auto;}
  .plan .ideal{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:300;color:#4b5169;line-height:1.4;padding-bottom:10px;margin-bottom:9px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .plan .ideal b{font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);}
  .plan .ideal span{display:block;font-size:.63rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--purple);margin-bottom:5px;}
  .plan.hot .ideal{color:#dfe4f7;border-bottom-color:rgba(255,255,255,.14);}
  .plan.hot .ideal b{color:#fff;}
  .plan.hot .ideal span{color:#bfe6f5;}
  .plan ul{list-style:none;margin:0 0 12px;flex:1;}
  .plan li{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:300;color:#464c63;padding:3px 0 3px 20px;position:relative;line-height:1.34;}
  .plan.hot li{color:#dfe4f7;}
  .plan li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:2px;top:10px;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--purple);}
  .plan.hot li::before{background:#fff;}
  .plan .btn{width:100%;justify-content:center;margin-top:auto;}
  .plan:not(.hot) .btn{background:var(--soft);color:var(--navy-800);}
  .plan:not(.hot) .btn:hover{background:var(--grad);color:#fff;}
  .plan-note{margin-top:30px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:300;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;}

  /* CONTACTO */
  .contacto{background:radial-gradient(900px 500px at 82% 0%,#1B347A 0%,transparent 60%),linear-gradient(160deg,#0A1240,#0F1E4D 60%,#16306B);color:#fff;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
  .contacto::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:-100px;bottom:-100px;width:400px;height:400px;background:radial-gradient(circle,#B81C9E33,transparent 66%);}
  .contacto .wrap{position:relative;z-index:2;}
  .contacto .eyebrow{color:#bfe6f5;}
  .contacto h2.title{color:#fff;max-width:760px;}
  .contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin:52px 0 22px;}
  .contact-grid.two{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
  .cc{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:14px;padding:22px 24px;transition:.25s;}
  .cc:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.11);transform:translateY(-4px);}
  .cc .ic{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:11px;background:var(--grad);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;}
  .cc .ic svg{width:22px;height:22px;fill:#fff;}
  .cc .t{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9aa2c9;}
  .cc .v{font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;margin-top:2px;word-break:break-all;}
  /* Tarjetas de contacto por ciudad, con acento propio */
  .cc-loc{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;padding:26px 26px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
  .cc-loc::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:.16;pointer-events:none;background:radial-gradient(360px 220px at 100% 0,var(--acc),transparent 68%);}
  .cc-loc>*{position:relative;z-index:1;}
  .cc-loc .ic{width:46px;height:46px;background:var(--acc-grad);}
  .cc-loc:hover{border-color:var(--acc);}
  .cc-loc .cc-body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;}
  .cc-loc .loc-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:30px;width:fit-content;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .cc-loc .loc-badge svg{width:12px;height:12px;fill:currentColor;}
  .cc-loc .nm{font-size:1.14rem;font-weight:600;}
  .cc-loc .role{font-size:.76rem;color:#9aa2c9;letter-spacing:.02em;}
  .cc-loc .v{font-size:1.02rem;font-weight:500;margin-top:8px;color:#e7ebff;}
  .loc-vd{--acc:#2DD4BF;--acc-grad:linear-gradient(135deg,#2DD4BF,#0E9F94);}
  .loc-cc{--acc:#FB923C;--acc-grad:linear-gradient(135deg,#FBBF24,#FB7185);}
  .loc-vd .loc-badge{background:rgba(45,212,191,.15);color:#7ff0e2;}
  .loc-cc .loc-badge{background:rgba(251,146,60,.16);color:#ffcda0;}
  .contact-alt{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:40px;}
  .contact-alt a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:400;color:#bfc6e8;padding:10px 17px;border-radius:30px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);transition:.2s;}
  .contact-alt a svg{width:16px;height:16px;fill:currentColor;opacity:.85;}
  .contact-alt a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.3);}
  .contacto .final-cta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;}

  /* FOOTER */
  footer{background:#080E30;color:#fff;padding:44px 0;}
  footer .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  footer .fbrand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;}
  footer .fbrand img{height:42px;}
  footer .fbrand .w{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:1rem;}
  footer .fbrand .w small{display:block;font-weight:300;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#8b93bd;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:3px;}
  footer .fc{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:300;color:#8b93bd;}

  /* reveal */
  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s ease;}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none;}

  /* RESPONSIVE */
  @media(max-width:900px){
    .hero .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px;}
    .hero-art{display:none;}
    .tri,.grid6,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .plan-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .plan.hot{transform:none;}
    .plan.hot:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);}
    .plan{min-height:auto;}
    .plan .body{position:static;}
    .plan .hint{display:none;}
    .plan .detail{position:static;opacity:1;transform:none;pointer-events:auto;}
    .contact-grid,.contact-grid.two{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    nav.links{position:fixed;inset:0 0 0 auto;width:min(78vw,320px);flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;gap:26px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#0F1E4D,#16306B);padding:40px;transform:translateX(100%);transition:.35s;box-shadow:-20px 0 60px rgba(0,0,0,.4);}
    nav.links.open{transform:none;}
    nav.links a{color:#fff !important;opacity:.95;font-size:1.05rem;}
    header:not(.scrolled) .burger span,header.scrolled .burger span{background:#fff;}
    header.scrolled .burger span{background:var(--navy-800);}
    .burger{display:flex;z-index:60;}
    .nav-cta{display:none;}
    .section{padding:74px 0;}
  }
  @media(max-width:520px){
    .plan-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .hero-stats{gap:26px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
    .rhythm{padding:26px;}
  }
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    *{animation:none !important;}
    .reveal{transition:none;opacity:1;transform:none;}
    html{scroll-behavior:auto;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header id="hdr">
  <div class="wrap bar">
    <a class="logo-nav" href="#top"><img class="mk" src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""><span class="wm">AUSTRAL <span class="grad-text">GROWTH</span></span></a>
    <nav class="links" id="menu">
      <a href="#servicios">Servicios</a>
      <a href="#proceso">Proceso</a>
      <a href="#planes">Planes</a>
      <a href="#contacto">Contacto</a>
      <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-grad nav-cta">Trabajemos juntos</a>
    </nav>
    <button class="burger" id="burger" aria-label="Menú"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Agencia de marketing digital · Sur de Chile</span>
      <h1>Despertemos<br><span class="grad-text">tu marca.</span></h1>
      <p class="sub">Impulsamos marcas mediante estrategia, contenido y marketing digital. Del sur de Chile para todo el país.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-grad">Trabajemos juntos</a>
        <a href="#planes" class="btn btn-ghost">Ver planes</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="s"><div class="n grad-text">6</div><div class="l">Motores de contenido</div></div>
        <div class="s"><div class="n grad-text">4</div><div class="l">Planes a tu medida</div></div>
        <div class="s"><div class="n grad-text">100%</div><div class="l">Enfoque en resultados</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- DIAGNÓSTICO -->
<section class="section diag reveal">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <span class="eyebrow grad-text">El diagnóstico</span>
      <h2 class="title">Tener seguidores no es<br>tener una marca viva.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Muchas cuentas acumulan público pero pierden movimiento: el contenido deja de llegar, la comunidad se enfría y las ventas se estancan. El número está; la energía no.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tri">
      <div class="card"><div class="dot"><i></i></div><h3>Alcance dormido</h3><p>Lo <b>reactivamos</b> con contenido que el algoritmo sí quiere mostrar.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="dot"><i></i></div><h3>Comunidad apagada</h3><p>La <b>encendemos</b> con historias e interacción real, no likes vacíos.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="dot"><i></i></div><h3>Ventas estancadas</h3><p>Las <b>movemos</b> llevando a tu audiencia del feed a la compra.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SERVICIOS -->
<section class="section serv reveal" id="servicios">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow grad-text">¿Qué hacemos?</span>
    <h2 class="title">Seis motores de contenido.</h2>
    <p class="lead">Cada pieza que creamos entra en uno de estos seis motores. Así tu marca crece con intención, no al azar.</p>
    <div class="grid6">
      <div class="mcard"><div class="idx grad-text">01</div><h3>Humor y viralidad</h3><p>Rompe el algoritmo y trae alcance nuevo a tu marca.</p></div>
      <div class="mcard"><div class="idx grad-text">02</div><h3>Educación</h3><p>Enseñar sobre lo tuyo genera confianza y autoridad.</p></div>
      <div class="mcard"><div class="idx grad-text">03</div><h3>Confianza y autoridad</h3><p>Mostramos por qué eres la mejor opción de tu rubro.</p></div>
      <div class="mcard"><div class="idx grad-text">04</div><h3>Producto y ofertas</h3><p>Del feed a la venta, al ritmo de cada mes.</p></div>
      <div class="mcard"><div class="idx grad-text">05</div><h3>Presencia local</h3><p>Conectamos tu marca con tu ciudad y tu público cercano.</p></div>
      <div class="mcard"><div class="idx grad-text">06</div><h3>Prueba social</h3><p>Clientes reales y comunidad activa que da confianza.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROCESO -->
<section class="section proc reveal" id="proceso">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow grad-text">Cómo trabajamos</span>
    <h2 class="title">De la estrategia al reel,<br>en tres pasos.</h2>
    <div class="steps">
